  "summary_en": "Microsoft's externally released Responsible AI Impact Assessment Template (June 2022), supporting its Responsible AI Standard v2. It structures internal assessment of AI systems: intended uses, stakeholders, harms, fairness, human oversight, adverse impacts, sensitive-use triggers, data requirements, and sign-off. General AI, with no robotics content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Requires impact assessment per AI system covering intended uses, stakeholders, benefits and harms",
   "Maps applicability of Responsible AI Standard Goals (accountability, transparency, fairness, reliability and safety, privacy and security, inclusiveness)",
   "Defines Sensitive Use triggers: legal position, physical or psychological injury, human rights",
   "Requires human oversight and control stakeholder identification and oversight levels",
   "Impact assessment must be reviewed and signed off, and updated at least annually"
